# .gitignore — Video-Pitch-Repo
# Prinzip: Code + Docs + Skripte ins Git; große Binaries raus (GitHub-Limit 100 MB/Datei).

# --- Render-Outputs (lokal behalten, per Release/Drive teilen) ---
renders/v1/
renders/v2/
renders/final/*.mp4
video/public/footage/*.mp4
video/public/ai-clips/*.mp4
video/public/renders3d/*.mp4
blender/renders/final/
*.mp4
!video/src/**/*.mp4

# --- Blender/ComfyUI Schwergewichte ---
*.blend1
blender/renders/previz/
comfy/output/
ComfyUI/output/

# --- Audio-Zwischenprodukte (reproduzierbar via tooling/tts_edge.py) ---
video/public/audio/*.mp3

# --- OS / Editor ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
!renders/render.log
node_modules/
.venv/
__pycache__/

# --- Secrets (dürfen hier nie landen) ---
.env
*.key
*api*key*
capture.webm
RELEASE-NOTES-*.md
